# Applied to every `pnpm <script>` via NODE_OPTIONS.
#
# DEP0040: wrangler bundles whatwg-url@5, which requires Node's deprecated
# `punycode` module, and every dev/check/test run loads wrangler (through
# the Cloudflare adapter) — so the warning printed on every command and
# nothing in this repo can fix it. Silence that one deprecation only.
node-options=--disable-warning=DEP0040
